    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>First Demo available now (free).</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a neon-lit dystopia full of exciting challenges in Nion Forge - the action-packed <strong>cyberpunk roguelite</strong>! Here you have the opportunity to <strong>build your own spaceship</strong> and fight above the dystopian streets as you face off against hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be surprised by unique upgrades and weapons that make every playthrough a new experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Nion Forge, you combine auto-firing weapons and special cockpit abilities and weapons to actively and passively take on masses of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only by selecting the best ship parts and perfecting your own play style can you master all 9 districts and defeat their bosses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Will you be the first fighter to escape the city arena and attain your freedom?</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/5c7bac72afa34b3869b0a77c0df59340.avif?t=1755084714\" width=297 height=67 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agile or powerful? What weapons, what drive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ship to suit your style and be better prepared next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/d141b22ec7fb2258276c2ee50a2cf45a.poster.avif?t=1755084714\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/d141b22ec7fb2258276c2ee50a2cf45a.webm?t=1755084714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/d141b22ec7fb2258276c2ee50a2cf45a.mp4?t=1755084714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/1dbee1790f580e0b3a59773940ca5331.avif?t=1755084714\" width=297 height=67 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face ever-growing hordes of enemies and battle until you're ready for the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat all 9 levels and bosses within a limited time to escape the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/b4dc2f400b08d550e7afe0dbbc4a416c.poster.avif?t=1755084714\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/b4dc2f400b08d550e7afe0dbbc4a416c.webm?t=1755084714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/b4dc2f400b08d550e7afe0dbbc4a416c.mp4?t=1755084714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/cfeb2ceb0c2ae08f64b330153330987b.poster.avif?t=1755084714\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/cfeb2ceb0c2ae08f64b330153330987b.webm?t=1755084714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/cfeb2ceb0c2ae08f64b330153330987b.mp4?t=1755084714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/a9177905840364716e2e0f0fe18110d8.avif?t=1755084714\" width=297 height=67 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeated enemies drop valuable materials,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >which you can trade between escape attempts for over 100 different ship modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/470dbc888ba7c1c8e9c3b51a5b85889f.poster.avif?t=1755084714\" width=500 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/470dbc888ba7c1c8e9c3b51a5b85889f.webm?t=1755084714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/470dbc888ba7c1c8e9c3b51a5b85889f.mp4?t=1755084714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
